[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Document Metadata
[/meta]

h1. Document Metadata

Tests for Section 1 of the specification.

h2. Output

h3. Meta alone produces no fragment output {#meta-only}
[code om]
[meta]
lang: uk
title: My Document
author: André Polykanine
[/meta]
[/code]
[code html]
[/code]

h3. Content after meta {#meta-then-paragraph}
[code om]
[meta]
lang: en
[/meta]

Hello.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Hello.</p>
[/code]

h3. Unknown keys are ignored {#meta-unknown-key}
[code om]
[meta]
color: blue
[/meta]
[/code]
[code html]
[/code]

h2. Placement

h3. Meta after content is an error {#meta-after-content}
[code om]
Hello.

[meta]
lang: en
[/meta]
[/code]
[code error]
meta-not-first 3
[/code]

h3. A second meta block is an error {#meta-twice}
[code om]
[meta]
lang: en
[/meta]
[meta]
title: Again
[/meta]
[/code]
[code error]
meta-not-first 4
[/code]

h3. Unclosed meta {#meta-unclosed}
[code om]
[meta]
lang: en
[/code]
[code error]
unclosed-block 1
[/code]

h3. Tag casing {#meta-case-sensitive}
[code om]
[Meta]
lang: en
[/Meta]
[/code]
[code html]
<p>[Meta]<br>
lang: en<br>
[/Meta]</p>
[/code]

h3. Blank lines may precede meta {#meta-after-blank-lines}
[code om]


[meta]
lang: en
[/meta]

Hello.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Hello.</p>
[/code]

h3. A comment may precede meta {#meta-after-comment}
[code om]
[comment]
Draft notes.
[/comment]
[meta]
lang: en
[/meta]

Hello.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Hello.</p>
[/code]

h3. Meta inside a container {#meta-inside-more}
[code om]
[more Details]
[meta]
lang: en
[/meta]
[/more]
[/code]
[code error]
meta-not-first 2
[/code]

h2. Profiles

h3. Meta is read in the standard profile {#meta-profile-standard}
; profile
: standard
[code om]
[meta]
lang: en
[/meta]
[/code]
[code html]
[/code]

h3. Meta is read in the basic profile {#meta-profile-basic}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
[meta]
lang: en
[/meta]

Hello.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Hello.</p>
[/code]

h3. Meta is not allowed in the inline profile {#meta-profile-inline}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
[meta]
lang: en
[/meta]
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]

h3. Several errors on one line: the first in the error table wins {#meta-profile-inline-unclosed}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
[meta]
[/code]
[code error]
unclosed-block 1
[/code]

h3. Meta can narrow the profile {#meta-profile-narrows}
[code om]
[meta]
profile: basic
[/meta]

h2. Heading
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 5
[/code]

h3. Meta selects a profile that allows its content {#meta-profile-selects}
; profile
: standard
[code om]
[meta]
profile: standard
[/meta]

h2. Heading
[/code]
[code html]
<h2 id="heading">Heading</h2>
[/code]

h3. The parser's profile wins over a wider document profile {#meta-profile-parser-wins}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
[meta]
profile: full
[/meta]

h2. Heading
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 5
[/code]
